{"seq":1,"slug":"natural-language-processing","title":"自然语言处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/natural-language-processing","wordCount":2168,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"自然语言处理\">自然语言处理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>自然语言处理（Natural Language Processing, NLP）是计算机科学与语言学的交叉领域，致力于让计算机理解、生成和处理人类语言。从搜索引擎的查询理解到智能助手的对话生成，从机器翻译到情感分析，NLP技术已经深度嵌入了日常数字生活的各个角落。NLP的核心挑战在于自然语言的模糊性、多义性和语境依赖性——人类语言不像编程语言那样精确和无歧义，计算机需要在不确定性中做出合理的推断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"nlp的发展脉络\">NLP的发展脉络</h3><p>NLP的发展经历了几次重大范式转变：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>方法范式</th>\n<th>核心思路</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1950s-1980s</td>\n<td>基于规则</td>\n<td>手工编写语言规则和词典</td>\n<td>ELIZA（对话）、SHRDLU（问答）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1990s-2010s</td>\n<td>统计方法</td>\n<td>从大量标注数据中学习概率模型</td>\n<td>IBM翻译模型、CRF序列标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2013-2018</td>\n<td>神经网络</td>\n<td>用深度学习端到端建模</td>\n<td>Word2Vec、LSTM、Seq2Seq</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2018至今</td>\n<td>预训练大模型</td>\n<td>在海量文本上预训练，下游任务微调</td>\n<td>BERT、GPT系列、ChatGPT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每次范式转变都带来了性能的飞跃。基于规则的方法在窄领域表现良好但难以扩展；统计方法利用数据克服了规则的脆弱性但需要大量特征工程；深度学习消除了手工特征的需求但需要大量标注数据；预训练大模型通过自监督学习从海量无标注文本中获取语言知识，将NLP带入了通用人工智能的门槛。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心nlp任务\">核心NLP任务</h3><p><strong>文本分类</strong>：将文本归入预定义的类别。应用场景包括垃圾邮件检测、情感分析（判断评论是正面还是负面）、新闻主题分类。传统方法使用TF-IDF特征+SVM/朴素贝叶斯分类器，当代方法使用BERT等预训练模型微调。</p>\n<p><strong>命名实体识别（NER）</strong>：从文本中识别出人名、地名、组织名、时间、金额等实体。&quot;张三明天去北京大学&quot;中需要识别：张三（人名）、明天（时间）、北京大学（机构名）。NER是信息抽取和知识图谱构建的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>句法分析（Parsing）</strong>：自动分析句子的语法结构。成分句法分析生成树形结构（S→NP VP），依存句法分析标注词与词之间的依存关系（&quot;吃&quot;的主语是&quot;我&quot;，宾语是&quot;饭&quot;）。依存分析在当代NLP中更为流行，因为其输出格式对下游任务更友好。</p>\n<p><strong>语义理解</strong>：让机器理解文本的&quot;意思&quot;。这是NLP中最困难的任务群。包括语义角色标注（谁对谁做了什么）、共指消解（&quot;他&quot;指的是谁）、文本蕴含（句子A能否推出句子B）和阅读理解（给定文章回答问题）。</p>\n<p><strong>文本生成</strong>：让机器产出自然流畅的文本。从早期的模板填充到当代的自回归语言模型（GPT系列），文本生成能力的飞跃是最令公众印象深刻的NLP进展。</p>\n<h3 id=\"词向量与语义表示\">词向量与语义表示</h3><p>将离散的词语转化为连续的数学向量是现代NLP的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>词袋模型（Bag of Words）</strong>：最简单的文本表示——将文本看作词语的集合，忽略词序。用词频或TF-IDF权重构成高维稀疏向量。简单有效但丢失了语序信息和语义关系。</p>\n<p><strong>分布式词向量</strong>：Firth的&quot;一个词的意义取决于它的上下文&quot;这一语言学洞见在计算上的实现。Word2Vec（Mikolov et al., 2013）通过预测词的上下文（Skip-gram模型）或通过上下文预测词（CBOW模型）来学习词向量。学到的向量捕捉了语义关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>king</mtext><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>man</mtext><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>woman</mtext><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>queen</mtext><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{\\text{king}} - \\vec{\\text{man}} + \\vec{\\text{woman}} \\approx \\vec{\\text{queen}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1719em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">king</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">man</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">woman</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queen</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种语义算术展示了词向量对语义关系的隐式编码能力。</p>\n<p><strong>上下文相关词向量</strong>：Word2Vec为每个词分配一个固定向量，但&quot;bank&quot;在&quot;river bank&quot;和&quot;investment bank&quot;中意义完全不同。ELMo（2018）和BERT（2018）通过在句子语境中动态生成词向量解决了多义词问题——同一个&quot;bank&quot;在不同上下文中会获得不同的向量表示。</p>\n<h3 id=\"transformer与预训练语言模型\">Transformer与预训练语言模型</h3><p><strong>Transformer架构</strong>（Vaswani et al., 2017）是当代NLP的基础。其核心创新是<strong>自注意力机制（Self-Attention）</strong>——对句子中的每个位置，计算它与所有其他位置的关联权重，从而捕捉任意距离的依赖关系。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Attention</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Attention}(Q, K, V) = \\text{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right)V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attention</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4684em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2528em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8572em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8172em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（Query）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>（Key）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>（Value）是输入的线性变换，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>是维度缩放因子。</p>\n<p><strong>BERT</strong>（Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers）使用Transformer编码器，通过掩码语言模型（Masked Language Model，随机遮盖15%的词并预测它们）在大规模文本上进行预训练。BERT的双向建模使其能同时利用左右上下文——在发布时几乎刷新了所有NLP基准任务的成绩。中文BERT的变体（如BERT-wwm、RoBERTa-zh、MacBERT）针对中文分词特点进行了优化。</p>\n<p><strong>GPT系列</strong>使用Transformer解码器，通过自回归语言模型（根据前文预测下一个词）进行预训练。GPT-3（1750亿参数）展示了少样本学习（few-shot learning）的涌现能力——不需要微调，仅通过在提示（prompt）中给出几个示例就能完成新任务。GPT-4和ChatGPT的指令跟随能力使得NLP从&quot;程序员调用API&quot;走向&quot;普通用户自然语言交互&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"nlp与中文处理的特殊挑战\">NLP与中文处理的特殊挑战</h3><p>中文NLP面临一些英文NLP不存在的挑战：</p>\n<p><strong>分词问题</strong>：英文以空格分隔词，中文则无天然的词边界。&quot;南京市长江大桥&quot;可以切分为&quot;南京市/长江/大桥&quot;或&quot;南京/市长/江大桥&quot;。中文分词是几乎所有中文NLP任务的前置步骤，虽然深度学习方法已经大幅降低了分词错误率，但歧义分词仍然是挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>字符表示的优势</strong>：由于分词的不完美，当代中文NLP越来越多地采用字符级表示（character-level），绕过分词步骤。BERT等模型天然支持字符级输入，且在很多任务上字符级模型的性能不逊于词级模型。</p>\n<p><strong>繁简转换与异体字</strong>：处理跨地区（大陆/港台）的中文文本时需要考虑繁简体差异。不仅是字形的一对一映射——&quot;头发/頭髮&quot;和&quot;发展/發展&quot;中的&quot;发&quot;对应不同的繁体字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>Word2Vec的语义算术（如&quot;king - man + woman ≈ queen&quot;）有什么理论意义和局限性？它能揭示真正的语义理解吗？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么BERT的双向模型在自然语言理解任务上表现优于GPT的单向模型？而GPT在生成任务上又有什么优势？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>中文分词中&quot;南京市长江大桥&quot;的歧义问题，能否通过上下文信息来消解？设计一个利用上下文的消歧策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>ChatGPT等大语言模型&quot;理解&quot;语言吗？从语言学和哲学的角度讨论&quot;语言理解&quot;的含义。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>宗成庆：《统计自然语言处理》——国内NLP经典教材</li>\n<li>Jurafsky &amp; Martin：《Speech and Language Processing》——全球最权威的NLP教材（第3版在线免费）</li>\n<li>Goldberg：《Neural Network Methods for Natural Language Processing》——神经网络NLP入门</li>\n<li>Devlin et al.（2019）：BERT原论文——预训练模型的里程碑</li>\n<li>刘知远等：《知识图谱与大语言模型》——LLM时代的NLP新发展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自然语言处理从基于规则的专家系统发展到基于大规模预训练的通用语言模型，经历了从手工特征到自动学习、从任务专用到通用智能的演变。词向量技术将语言学的分布假设转化为可计算的数学表示。Transformer架构和自注意力机制是当代NLP的基础设施。BERT和GPT分别代表了理解和生成两个方向的突破。中文NLP面临分词等特殊挑战，但字符级模型和预训练方法正在有效应对。大语言模型的涌现能力正在模糊NLP与通用人工智能的边界，但对它们是否真正&quot;理解&quot;语言的追问仍然是一个开放的科学和哲学问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自然语言处理","id":"自然语言处理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"NLP的发展脉络","id":"nlp的发展脉络"},{"level":3,"text":"核心NLP任务","id":"核心nlp任务"},{"level":3,"text":"词向量与语义表示","id":"词向量与语义表示"},{"level":3,"text":"Transformer与预训练语言模型","id":"transformer与预训练语言模型"},{"level":3,"text":"NLP与中文处理的特殊挑战","id":"nlp与中文处理的特殊挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"双语现象","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/linguistics/sociolinguistics/bilingualism"},"next":{"title":"语音识别","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/linguistics/computational-linguistics/speech-recognition"}}